        <p>REPEALED</p>
        
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
        
        <p>Date Passed: Monday, March 16, 2026</p><p>Effective Date: Sunday, April 26, 2026</p><p>ORD C36850 Section 4</p>					<a href="/smc/?Section=10.55.090">Section 10.55.090</a> REPEALED (Indemnity – License Revocation)<br />
